      "value": "I am not sure if this is unexpected. VRChat already said that they can't disable animators without breaking a lot of avatars so they had to choose between breaking avatars or improving the game performances. I agree that it's pretty bad if Avatar culling only hide meshes and they should definitely optimise culled avatars better than this",
